ight-through fraction ≈ 1, slight-deflection line count ≈ round(2 + 0.8·t) capped at ~16, large-angle line count fixed at 2–4 regardless of t. LABELS: black sans-serif text with thin black leader lines — 'Radium source of α particles' below-left pointing up to the source dot; 'Beam of α particles' above the midpoint of the beam pointing down; 'Luminescent screen to detect scattered α particles' below-center pointing up to the near-front of the ring; 'Thin gold foil' below-right pointing up to the foil; 'Most α particles pass straight through foil' top-right pointing down to the forward bundle; 'A few α particles are slightly deflected' top-center-right pointing down to the small-angle fan; 'A very small number of α particles are significantly deflected' top-center-left pointing down-right to a back-scattered line.",
